<title>USA: Sioux City cattle $1.00-2.00 lower - USDA.</title>
<headline>Sioux City cattle $1.00-2.00 lower - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SIOUX CITY 1997-06-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trade moderate.  Compared to last Tuesday, slaughter steers and  heifers $1.00, instances 2.00 lower. - USDA</p>
<p>Slaughter Steers:  Choice 2-3, drug free 1275 lbs 64.85.</p>
<p>Choice 2-3, 1100-1350 lbs 63.00-64.00, individual 1375 lbs 64.75.</p>
<p>Select and Choice 2-3, 1075-1300 lbs 62.00-63.00.  Select 2-3, 59.00-61.00.</p>
<p>Returning  to the feedlot 975-1050 lbs 65.00-66.35.</p>
<p>Slaughter Heifers:  Choice 2-3, drug free 1125 lbs 64.75.</p>
<p>Choice  2-3,  1025-1275  lbs 63.00-64.00.</p>
<p>Select and Choice 2-3,  1000-1200  lbs 61.50-63.00.</p>
<p>Select 59.00-61.00.</p>
</text>
